      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Fase de activos v2 — VALIDACIÓN EN LOTE (vía sub-workflow)\nStaging/diff/ingest ahora en `Tryton sync snipe-IT assets ingest (batch)` (Execute ingest). Catálogos: fases originales intactas.\nSub: `Reset staging` → `Load staging (bulk)` → `Diff assets` → `Any changes?` → loop `Batch changes`/`Create|Update` → `Run summary` (sync_run_summary).\nIncremental 2026-09-06: `Search assets` filtra `OR(write_date,create_date) >= Get last sync` (MAX finished_at -2h; NULL/TRYTON_FULL_SYNC=true = full); `Has assets?` salta catálogos con 0 filas; `Run summary` solo cuenta deleted en full.",
